    <string name="guia_uso_titulo">ARCADIA GUIDE</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_bienvenido">Welcome to ArcadiaGames. Here you can manage your gamer catalog in a premium way.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_menu_principal">1. Menu</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_menu_principal_desc">In the main menu of Arcadia Games you can see our best news and offers on the most recent games.
        Swipe right or left to see the different games on offer.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_catalogo">2. Catalog</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_catalogo_desc">Tap on any game to see details, stock, and purchase or rental options.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_filtros">3. Filters</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_filtros_desc">Use the top search bar or platform chips to find what you are looking for instantly.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_incidencias">4. Incidents</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_incidencias_desc">In the incidents tab you can notify the team about any problem related to the app.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_anadir_juego">5. Add Game</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_anadir_juego_desc">Here you can add any game to the ArcadiaGames catalog so that anyone can buy or rent it.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_anadir_juego_desc_2">To add a new game you need the name, price, stock, and an image to add the product.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_mis_juegos">6. My Games</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_mis_juegos_desc">In the my games tab you can see the games you have purchased or rented in the store.</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_intercambios">7. Exchange</string>
    <string name="guia_uso_intercambios_desc">In the Exchange tab you can trade games with other users safely and effectively.</string>

